msgstr "Comment contribuer"

#: ../../source/contributing.md:7
msgid "1. Fork the Project"
msgstr "1. Forker le projet"

#: ../../source/contributing.md:15
msgid "2. Set Up a Development Environment"
msgstr "2. Créer un environnement de développement"

#: ../../source/contributing.md:25
msgid ""
"The `[dev]` extra installs pytest, pytest-cov, mypy, sphinx, myst-parser,"
" interrogate, and other development tools."
